 the maximum of the set {{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${x}_{max}$ is the maximum of a set $S$ if ${x}_{max}\\in S$ and $x\\le {x}_{max}$ for all $x\\in S,$ and\n\n- ${x}_{min}$ is the minimum of a set $S$ if ${x}_{min}\\in S$ and ${x}_{min}\\le x$ for all $x\\in S.$\n\nNotice that $-2\\notin A$ and $1\\notin A.$ So, we have the following:\n\n- $min(A)=min(-2,1),$ which $\\text{does not exist}$\n\n- $max(A)=max(-2,1),$ which $\\text{does not exist}$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186406951 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059700 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1e1c01fd-dea0-5761-9499-d622a34fea3e" :knowledge-point/title "Completing a Truth Table With Compound Statements"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8a334099-1f7f-5c0b-aead-371217a694de" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406935} {:answer/id #uuid "a2888028-3901-5c34-ae8a-4a28ac3aca86" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406938}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a2888028-3901-5c34-ae8a-4a28ac3aca86" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406938} :answer-field/id #uuid "2aee77f4-9be5-5c3a-80a1-10941ff43d8b" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406944} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4e14bb50-b52f-54ce-95fb-59ff76aadc0e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406927} {:answer/id #uuid "f722b6c6-65d9-5629-96ce-1fb6fc2acbcb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406942}] :answer-field/correct {:ans