s equivalent to the statement that {{field-2}}{{field-3}} $k,$ we have {{field-4}}." :question/worked-solution "The notation $a∤b$ means $a$ does not divides $b.$ So, $6∤11$ means $6\\text{ doesn't divide }11.$\n\nAccording to the definition of integer divisibility, the fact that $a$ does not divide $b$ means that for any integer $k,$ we have that \n\n$$\nb\\ne ak.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, $6∤11$ is equivalent to the statement that $\\text{for any}$ $\\text{integer}$ $k,$ we have $11\\ne 6k.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186407493 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186161918 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "05d3b242-3ecd-54d6-a763-925e2baada2c" :knowledge-point/title "Stating the Definition of Non-Divisibility"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "65696e4e-5c4b-508e-8f98-6f072b426021" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "for some" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407377} {:answer/id #uuid "6d77f00c-fdde-5d33-b0a3-0b93e105b300" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "for any" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407381}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6d77f00c-fdde-5d33-b0a3-0b93e105b300" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "for any" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407381} :answer-field/id #uuid "5409e8f8-c89d-5956-9af5-4aead9fa5bcd" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407463} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "120145e5-ce36-5d3e-8425-5ff89fa57186" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "number" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407345} {:answer/id #uuid "14b34004-b613-54e3-9703-eedc75a5ef13" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "integer" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407349}] :answer-field/correct {:answer